2026-05-26 15:36:01,902 | INFO | HTTP Request: POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/chat "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
2026-05-26 15:36:01,903 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To guarantee strict compliance with GDPR and meet the specified security and regulatory requirements, several measures must be implemented. Firstly, hosting data exclusively on EU territory is already ensured as our standard data residency is EU only. Additionally, cross-border transfer of data is prohibited by default unless an explicit legal basis exists, which aligns with the requirement of no data transfer outside the EU.

